{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Apes are taking over!! In Apes vs. Everyone, step into the minds of greedy apes on a mission for destruction. Conquer 5 unique areas with a total of 100 levels, unlock new challenges and secret minigames. Unleash chaos and rip through your enemies! Test your luck to see if you have the chops to conquer the world in the name of ape glory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068710/extras/19f84cac9f285dad4956d1a724d9d527.avif?t=1760976733\" width=742 height=356 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the humans by flinging your gorillas at their defenses! Collect as many stars as you can to unlock the next area! Collect all the stars in a world to unlock an extra area specific challenge or minigame!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068710/extras/392e85490a947b01d780c3bfb1450488.avif?t=1760976733\" width=704 height=434 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068710/extras/c24f79eca58708692e7e404d35c3cb71.webp?t=1760976733\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068710/extras/c24f79eca58708692e7e404d35c3cb71.poster.avif?t=1760976733\" class=\"bb_img\" width=460 height=440 /></picture></span> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4068710?t=1760976733","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4068710?t=1760976733","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068710/b78c9b17409a6264178bb6ea27213a519e987a94/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760976733","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/